  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "UFO researcher Grant Cameron, speaking on podcast host Jesse Michels's show, tells how in 1989 in Las Vegas the TV reporter George Knapp phoned John Lear, a pilot with a strong interest in UFOs, and said he was missing a guest for that night's show. According to Cameron, that is how Bob Lazar, a man who says he worked on alien craft at a secret site in the Nevada desert, ended up on air, and his story spread widely from there."
